-- §13.15 (issue #17 part 3): the Prelude is imported by default in
-- the top-level file, prefixless — its one-shot machines preregister
-- statics (Newline, Version) as bytestring handles. Binds are
-- deferred effects, so consumers gate on the (Bytes, H) completion
-- tuples (§9) rather than racing them.
(Bytes, Version), (Bytes, Newline) :
  [say "Lindana %b" Version; say "newline bound%b" Newline; exit 0]
